  "releaseNotes": "- Add support for [aspnet-client-validation](https://www.npmjs.com/package/aspnet-client-validation) library.\n- Refactoring (and renaming) JavaScripts files.\n- Add support for *IClientModelValidator* while procesing *Operands* in *predicate* validators. This will increase the number of *ValidationAttribute* available in client-side for predicates.\n- Fix some edge cases for `In` and `NotIn` validators.\n- Fix some issues with the `RequiredIf` validators family.",
